1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:04,260
(Amy(on webcam):)Well, normally I respect
your macho rebellious attitude

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,990
toward "The Man,"

3
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:09,800
(Amy(on webcam):)but, in this case, I think
you've made a foolish mistake.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,460
(Sheldon:)Unlikely.

5
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:13,830
(Sheldon:)But make your case.

6
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:16,340
(Sheldon:)Keeping in mind that
your critical attitude

7
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,340
(Sheldon:)is ruining our
Saturday night together,

8
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:21,110
(Sheldon:)and I'm not above
minimizing your window.

9
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:23,440
(Amy:)Sheldon, like it or not,

10
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,880
(Amy:)until you manage
to upload your intelligence

11
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:27,850
(Amy:)into a self-sustaining
orbiting satellite,

12
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:30,220
(Amy:)equipped with high-speed
Internet and a cloaking device,

13
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:33,520
(Amy:)you will be dependent on other
members of the human race.

14
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:36,290
(Sheldon:)That's it.
Prepare to be minimized.

15
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:38,090
(Amy:)I'm not finished.

16
00:00:38,090 --> 00:00:39,790
(Amy:)All scientists have
to fund-raise, Sheldon.

17
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:42,060
(Amy:)How do you think
I paid for my lab?

18
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,630
I went to Saudi Arabia
and met with a prince

19
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:46,530
who had an interest
in neurobiology.

20
00:00:46,530 --> 00:00:50,330
(Sheldon:)Your lab is funded by some
Middle-Eastern dilettante?

21
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:53,040
(Amy:)Technically,
Faisal is my fiancé.

22
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:57,670
(Amy:)But I do have a state-of-the-art
two-photon microscope

